  annotations:
  - name: annotate1
    mode: annotate
    title: Vendored Convoy host app -- DO NOT EDIT HERE
    text: |-
      These are VENDORED COPIES of the host-app daemon, carried inside the .tox so an
      install works offline. The source of truth is dev/convoy/*.py -- edit there, then
      re-vendor (copy the files over embody/Embody/convoy/host/; the DATs are syncfile
      and pick the change up). An edit made HERE is overwritten by the next re-vendor.

      test_convoy_host_vendor.py asserts these stay identical to dev/convoy/ (comparing
      newline-normalized text: Embody writes CRLF on Windows, .gitattributes stores LF).

      The daemon is TD-free and never imported in TouchDesigner -- it is inert text here.
      On install, ConvoyExt reads each DAT's .text on the main thread and a worker writes
      it to the per-user data dir.
    position: [-70, -870]
    size: [1470, 1130]
    color: [0.45, 0.45, 0.45]
